      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Loud noise wakes you up. You quickly regain consciousness and stand on your feet as you realize you've been just dragged in, what seems to be an improvised prisoner section.::

Greg, pick up what we've found on $(#him/her) and get it back there. Argh, I can't hold it in anymore ::He grabs his crotch.:: I *umpf*, I gotta take a leak.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
