      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::You can see the keychain with a single key on his right hip. Looking at his eyes you realize he is not really paying attention to you, as if he cannot see you. Observing him further, you realize that he is actually cross-eyed. At this point, it's hard to tell if he has any idea what's going on behind the bars where you are. The fence before you has several large gaps in it::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
