        <source>::You kick the fence close to the ground, causing some noise. He reacts to it by slightly lowering his head, trying to see what was the cause. In a blink of an eye, you uncover your shiv and stab him precisely into his neck. From the initial shock, he raises his head back up, expanding the would in process as you hold firm to the shiv. At last, you move the shiv to the other side, slicing a huge chunk of his throat. A huge gush of blood starts pouring out as he starts to collapse.::

&lt;end&gt;</source>
