        <source>::As you approach this man, he doesn't notice you as he is totally focused on preparing his food. Observing him for a few moments, you figure out that he's mixing some smelly ingredients, culminating in a weird looking green meal. Once he finished with his new batch, he turns his head and adresses you.::

